OL,3,AMan, 82, dies after beach fight with
OL,4,A76-year-old over sunlounger in Greece
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 82-year-old man has died after
OL,7,Fgetting into a fight with a man in his
OL,8,F70s over a sunlounger on a beach in
OL,9,FGreece, local media is reporting.
OL,11,FWitnesses say a disagreement over the
OL,12,Fuse of the loungers at Vouliagmeni
OL,13,Fbeach, near Athens, escalated into a
OL,14,Fviolent fight, which then further
OL,15,Fspiralled to involve other people.
OL,17,FOne eyewitness told the Kathimerini
OL,18,Fnewspaper that the scene was so
OL,19,Fchaotic, the screaming could be heard
OL,20,Ffrom the other end of the beach.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
