OL,3,AMan, 82, dies after beach fight with
OL,4,A76-year-old over sunlounger in Greece
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe younger man, who was 76, has
OL,7,Freportedly been arrested. A 21-year-old
OL,8,Fwoman who was with him was also
OL,9,Fdetained but later released. Witnesses
OL,10,Ftold Ta Nea daily newspaper that she
OL,11,Fhad a bloodied and swollen face.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
